      "chapter_reference": "ጴጥ 2፥21; መዝ 59፥1–5; ምሳሌ 6፥21; መኃ 8፥6; ዮሐ 5፥8; ማቴ 10፥32",
      "locator_label": "SS-001-S010-P001"
    },
    {
      "key": "SS-001-S010-P002",
      "section_key": "SS-001-S010",
      "block_type": "paragraph",
      "content": "የማዕተቡ ቀለሞች ሦስት ነበሩ፦ ቀይ፣ ጥቁርና ቢጫ። ያዕቆብ ካጠመቃቸው በኋላ እነዚህን በአንድነት ገምዶ ያስርላቸው ነበር። ሦስት ዓይነት ሆኖ በአንድ መገመዱ የሥላሴ የሦስትነትና የአንድነት ምሳሌ ነው። ይህ ማዕተብ ተጠማቂው ጥምቀትን መፈጸሙን፣ ከሥላሴ ልጅነት ማግኘቱንና ክርስትናውን ይመሰክራል።",
      "content_hash": "1e1596d73afac4",
      "page_start": null,
      "page_end": null,
      "review_notes": [],
      "chapter_reference": null,
      "locator_label": "SS-001-S010-P002"
    },
    {
      "key": "SS-001-S011-P001",
      "section_key": "SS-001-S011",
      "block_type": "paragraph",
      "content": "ሀ. ካህኑ ሰውነትን በሚያጠልቅ ገንዳ ውስጥ ባለው ውሃ ላይ የሚያደርገው ሥርዓተ ጸሎት ይሰማል፤ ሲባርክም ይታያል።",
      "content_hash": "17ff32b29a3b9d",
      "page_start": null,
      "page_end": null,
      "review_notes": [],
      "chapter_reference": null,
      "locator_label": "SS-001-S011-P001"
    },
    {
      "key": "SS-001-S011-P002",
      "section_key": "SS-001-S011",
      "block_type": "paragraph",
      "content": "ለ. ተጠማቂው ውሃ ውስጥ ሦስት ጊዜ በሥላሴ ስም ብቅ ጥልቅ ማለቱ።",
      "content_hash": "104b710866fb2d",
      "page_start": null,
      "page_end": null,
      "review_notes": [],
      "chapter_reference": null,
      "locator_label": "SS-001-S011-P002"
    },
    {
      "key": "SS-001-S011-P003",
      "section_key": "SS-001-S011",
      "block_type": "paragraph",
      "content": "ሐ. የትንሣኤ ዘጉባኤ (የብርሃን) ምሳሌ የሚጎናጸፈው ነጭ ልብስ",
      "content_hash": "13ae2f20463147",
      "page_start": null,
      "page_end": null,
      "review_notes": [],
      "chapter_reference": null,
      "locator_label": "SS-001-S011-P003"
    },
    {
      "key": "SS-001-S011-P004",
      "section_key": "SS-001-S011",
      "block_type": "paragraph",
      "content": "በጥምቀት የሚገኝ የማይታይ ጸጋ",
      "content_hash": "1c6dce40cb7929",
      "page_start": null,
      "page_end": null,
      "review_notes": [],
      "chapter_reference": null,
      "locator_label": "SS-001-S011-P004"
    },
    {
      "key": "SS-001-S011-P005",
      "section_key": "SS-001-S011",
      "block_type": "paragraph",
      "content": "ሀ. ገንዳው ማኅፀነ ዮርዳኖስ፣ ውሃውም ማየ ገቦ መሆን።",
      "content_hash": "1ca8802933924e",
      "page_start": null,
      "page_end": null,
      "review_notes": [],
      "chapter_reference": null,
      "locator_label": "SS-001-S011-P005"
    },
    {
      "key": "SS-001-S011-P006",
      "section_key": "SS-001-S011",
      "block_type": "paragraph",
      "content": "ለ. ተጠማቂው ከአብራከ መንፈስ ቅዱስ ዳግም መወለድ። ቲቶ 3፥5፤ ዮሐ 3፥3።",
      "content_hash": "02864f4fc859bc",
      "page_start": null,
      "page_end": null,
      "review_notes": [],
      "chapter_reference": "ቲቶ 3፥5; ዮሐ 3፥3",
      "locator_label": "SS-001-S011-P006"
    },
    {
      "key": "SS-001-S011-P007",
      "section_key": "SS-001-S011",
      "block_type": "paragraph",
      "content": "ሐ. መንፈሳዊ ድኅነትና የነፍስ ፈውስ ማግኘት። ማር 16፥16።",
      "content_hash": "073e95d36028b9",
      "page_start": null,
      "page_end": null,
      "review_notes": [],
      "chapter_reference": "ማር 16፥16",
      "locator_label": "SS-001-S011-P007"
    },
    {
      "key": "SS-001-S011-P008",
      "section_key": "SS-001-S011",
      "block_type": "paragraph",
      "content": "መ. ክርስቶስን መልበስ (መምሰል)። ገላ 3፥27።",
      "content_hash": "001a119d52884e",
      "page_start": null,
      "page_end": null,
      "review_notes": [],
      "chapter_reference": "ገላ 3፥27",
      "locator_label": "SS-001-S011-P008"
    },
    {
      "key": "SS-001-S011-P009",
      "section_key": "SS-001-S011",
      "block_type": "paragraph",
      "content": "ሠ. ንጽሕና፣ ቅድስና፣ የዘለዓለም ሕይወት፣ የመንፈስ ቅዱስ ጸጋና ከምዕመናን ጋር አንድነት ማግኘት።",
      "content_hash": "14b9d40a3b5dcd",
      "page_start": null,
      "page_end": null,
      "review_notes": [],
